<title>ITALY: Italy details August new car registrations.</title>
<headline>Italy details August new car registrations.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian new car registrations in the period January to August 1996 totalled 1.233 million units, down 0.18 percent on the 1.235 million in the same period last year, the Ministry of Transport said.</p>
<p>Aug  96 registrations Mkt shre %  Aug 95   Mkt shre</p>
<p>Fiat	     31,040    41.94    35,660    44.57</p>
<p>Volkswagen	9,570    12.94    11,766    14.71</p>
<p>General Motors  6,600     8.92     6,288     7.86</p>
<p>Ford		6,000     8.11     7,270     9.09</p>
<p>PSA Peugeot     5,750     7.77     5,963     7.45</p>
<p>Renault	   4,300     5.81     4,238     5.30</p>
<p>BMW		 3,600     4.86     2,310     2.89</p>
<p>Mercedes	  1,600     2.16     1,233     1.54</p>
<p>Nissan	    1,400     1.89     1,589     1.99</p>
<p>Volvo		 800     1.08	 549     0.69</p>
<p>NOTE - Fiat comprises Fiat, Alfa Romeo, Lanci</p>
<p>-- Milan bureau +392 66129502</p>
</text>
